<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Central Garden &amp; Pet.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Central Garden &amp; Pet.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist analyst Jean-Michel Valette said, based on his preliminary analysis, Central Garden &amp; Pet Co's acquisition of Sandoz Agro Inc's flea and tick business could add $0.05 to $0.10 per share to Central Garden's earnings.</p>
<p>-- In a written statement, he reiterated a buy rating on the stock. He noted the addition of the high margin branded products is a &quot;major step&quot; in Central Garden's growth plan.</p>
<p>-- Central Garden's shares were up 1-1/8 to 23-1/8 in late afternoon trading.</p>
</text>
